    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the environmental conservation law, in relation to limiting\nthe exceptions to certain effluent limitations in Nassau and Suffolk counties\nand requiring certain eligible projects for state aid involving water\npollution control revolving fund agreements to take county-wide or regional\nwastewater planning into consideration when determining eligibility",
    "basePrintNo": "S5022",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S5022-2021",
    "coSponsors": {
